        (231, true, 'Venom shares his symbiotes with Jeff and Hela. Jeff''s <Orange>Guardian of the Deep</> links with nearby allies for continuous healing, releasing a large healing burst that converts any excess into <Buff>Bonus Health</> when it ends. Hela''s <Orange>Hel Tendrils</> unleash a symbiotic Hel Sphere that pulls in nearby enemies and links them, <Debuff>slowing</> those that try to escape.', 103582, '/abilities/103582.webp', 'Healing Tendrils', 'Passive', 22),
