        (239, false, 'PRESS {Jump} to crawl on vertical surfaces, and PRESS {PrimaryAttack} to run on them.', 103671, '/abilities/103671.webp', 'Wall Crawl', 'Normal', 23),
        (240, false, 'Launch an enemy upward, dealing extra damage to the enemy with a <Orange>Spider-Tracer</>.', 103613, '/abilities/103613.webp', 'Amazing Combo', 'Normal', 23),
        (241, true, 'Venom shares a part of his symbiotes with {103600}{000003}{104200}, activating their symbiote abilities. {103600}{000003}{104200} can convert the symbiotes into explosive spikes that inflict harm on nearby enemies and relentlessly drive them back.', 103692, '/abilities/103692.webp', 'Suit Expulsion', 'Normal', 23),
        (242, true, 'Spider-Man gives Squirrel Girl a web bomb. She can launch it to unleash an explosion upon contact with the environment or an enemy, briefly <Debuff>Immobilizing</> and damaging enemies caught in the blast.', 103691, '/abilities/103691.webp', 'Extra Web-fluid', 'Normal', 23),
        (243, true, 'Human Torch stores <Orange>Pyrokinetic Energy</> in Spider-Man''s suit, enabling him to unleash an <Orange>Inferno Blast</> that sprays a fiery web while performing a backflip to create distance. The flames damage enemies and apply a <Orange>Burn-Tracer</>. Detonating these <Orange>Burn-Tracers</> inflicts Damage Over Time.', 103693, '/abilities/103693.webp', 'Inferno Blast', 'Normal', 23),
        (244, false, 'Hold {Jump} to fall slowly.', 103702, '/abilities/103702.webp', 'Magnetic Descent', 'Passive', 24),
        (245, false, 'Fire a volley of magnetic orbs forward. The range of the resulting explosion increases based on distance flown.', 103711, '/abilities/103711.webp', 'Iron Volley', 'Weapon', 24),
        (246, false, 'Convert the iron rings on Magneto''s back into a Mag-Cannon and launch a metallic mass forward. Higher stacks of rings increase damage, and full stacks <Debuff>Knock Back</> enemies.', 103721, '/abilities/103721.webp', 'Mag-cannon', 'Normal', 24),
        (247, false, 'Change the magnetic field around to form a metallic curtain, blocking all incoming <Orange>Projectiles</>.', 103731, '/abilities/103731.webp', 'Metallic Curtain', 'Normal', 24),
        (248, false, 'Conjure a metal shield around a chosen ally. Damage taken will transform into rings on Magneto''s back.', 103741, '/abilities/103741.webp', 'Metal Bulwark', 'Normal', 24),
        (249, false, 'Draw in all materials around to forge an iron meteor that deals massive damage upon impact. Absorbing enemy <Orange>Projectiles</> can enhance the meteor''s power, yet overloading will cause it to self-destruct.', 103761, '/abilities/103761.webp', 'Meteor M', 'Ultimate', 24),
        (250, true, 'Scarlet Witch can infuse Chaos Energy into Magneto to enchant his greatsword. Upon receiving the Chaos Energy, Magneto can unleash its full force, striking down enemies with his enchanted greatsword.', 103791, '/abilities/103791.webp', 'Metallic Fusion', 'Normal', 24),
        (251, false, 'Conjure an iron shield around himself. Damage taken will transform into rings on Magneto''s back.', 103743, '/abilities/103743.webp', 'Iron Bulwark', 'Normal', 24),
        (252, true, 'Emma Frost can form a mental link with Magneto and Psylocke, calling on her to create illusory projections. When together, Emma Frost will create a Mental Projection of Magneto and Psylocke, forming a Duplicate Illusion in the enemy''s perspective that confuses foes by moving and casting abilities on its own.', 103792, '/abilities/103792.webp', 'Magnetic Resonance', 'Normal', 24),
        (253, false, 'HOLD {Jump} to fall slowly.', 103871, '/abilities/103871.webp', 'Telekinesis', 'Normal', 25),
