        (313, true, 'Hulk charges Namor with gamma radiation. When Namor receives the radiation, he will summon an extra <Orange>Gamma Monstro</> which will continuously fire gamma rays at locked-on enemies. The longer the rays hit, the higher the damage.', 104591, '/abilities/104591.webp', 'Gamma Monstro', 'Normal', 31),
