        (316, false, 'Gather quantum energy into a cluster and then swiftly launch it at the enemy. Each hit reduces <Orange>Avatar Life Stream</> charge time.', 104621, '/abilities/104621.webp', 'Cosmic Cluster', 'Normal', 32),
