        (341, false, 'Slash nearby enemies with a psionic katana, dealing massive damage.', 104861, '/abilities/104861.webp', 'Dance Of The Butterfly', 'Normal', 34),
        (342, true, 'When Magik is on the field, {102600} can tap into Limbo to rewind a few seconds back to a previous position; after passing through Limbo, {102600} will gain <Buff>Bonus Health</> based on missing health.', 104895, '/abilities/104895.webp', 'Psionic Disc', 'Normal', 34),
        (343, true, 'Emma Frost can form a mental link with Magneto and Psylocke, calling on her to create illusory projections. When together, Emma Frost will create a Mental Projection of Magneto and Psylocke, forming a Duplicate Illusion in the enemy''s perspective that confuses foes by moving and casting abilities on its own.', 104892, '/abilities/104892.webp', 'Psychic Echoes', 'Normal', 34),
        (344, false, 'Begin to heal and rise with a hefty <Buff>Bonus Health</>, shaking off all debuffs. After a brief moment, any remaining <Buff>Bonus Health</> morphs into a one-off heal, zeroing out his <Orange>Rage</>. Assists in KOs reduce this cooldown.', 104901, '/abilities/104901.webp', 'Regenerative Healing Factor', 'Normal', 35),
        (345, false, '<Orange>Rage</> builds when Wolverine attacks or takes hits, boosting the damage of his <Orange>Claw Strikes</> and the <Buff>Bonus Health</> from his regenerative healing factor.', 104921, '/abilities/104921.webp', 'Berserker Rage', 'Normal', 35),
        (346, false, 'Slash with Adamantium claws for a <Orange>Claw Strike</>. Unleashing <Orange>Feral Leap</> will enhance it to <Orange>Berserk Claw Strike</> for a brief period.', 104941, '/abilities/104941.webp', 'Savage Claw', 'Normal', 35),
        (347, false, 'Dash forward and unleash a <Orange>Claw Strike</>.', 104951, '/abilities/104951.webp', 'Vicious Rampage', 'Normal', 35),
        (348, false, 'Unleash a fierce howl to briefly reduce incoming damage.', 104961, '/abilities/104961.webp', 'Undying Animal', 'Normal', 35),
        (349, false, 'Leap like an animal to snatch the first enemy upon impact and <Debuff>Smash</> them to the ground. Unleashing this ability will enhance his normal attack to <Orange>Berserk Claw Strike</> for a brief period.', 104971, '/abilities/104971.webp', 'Feral Leap', 'Normal', 35),
        (350, false, '<Debuff>Launch Up</> enemies ahead and spiral through the air, sweeping up enemies along the path and delivering a devastating impact at the landing point. Impact deals extra damage based on <Orange>Rage</> accumulated.', 104981, '/abilities/104981.webp', 'Last Stand', 'Ultimate', 35),
        (351, true, 'Wolverine, Hulk{000003}{105100} can interact with each other. Once both parties confirm, Hulk{000003}{105100} can lift Wolverine and press the key to hurl him forward.', 104991, '/abilities/104991.webp', 'Metal Cannonball', 'Normal', 35),
        (352, true, 'Jean Grey imbues Wolverine with the awe-inspiring Phoenix Force. With this power, Wolverine''s <Orange>Feral Leap</> transforms into <Orange>Phoenix Warrior</>. While active, he is enveloped in Phoenix flames that continuously scorch nearby enemies, dealing Percentage Damage. In this state, Wolverine''s abilities gain <Buff>Lifesteal</> when inflicting damage.', 104994, '/abilities/104994.webp', 'Phoenix Warrior', 'Normal', 35),
        (353, false, 'Invisible Woman automatically becomes invisible 3 seconds after disengaging from combat.', 105002, '/abilities/105002.webp', 'Psionic Invisibility', 'Passive', 36),
        (354, false, 'Invisible Woman unleashes a devastating three-hit combo, each blow containing concentrated power of the force fields to strike foes. The third hit will launch up enemies in front of her.', 105011, '/abilities/105011.webp', 'Psionic Hammer', 'Normal', 36),
        (355, false, 'When falling, Invisible Woman can perform a super jump and become invisible by pressing the space bar.', 105021, '/abilities/105021.webp', 'Invisible Energy', 'Normal', 36),
        (356, false, 'Invisible Woman generates a force shield in front of a selected ally. Once broken, the shield explodes to create a healing field.', 105041, '/abilities/105041.webp', 'Psionic Support', 'Normal', 36),
        (357, false, 'Invisible Woman gathers psionic energy and throws it to create a vortex that pulls in enemies.', 105051, '/abilities/105051.webp', 'Psionic Vortex', 'Normal', 36),
        (358, false, 'Invisible Woman releases a cylindrical force field shockwave in the targeted direction, launching enemies up.', 105061, '/abilities/105061.webp', 'Psionic Surge', 'Normal', 36),
        (359, false, 'Channeling her potential, Invisible Woman manifests an unseen force field, rendering allies inside undetectable by enemies and healing them.', 105071, '/abilities/105071.webp', 'Invisible', 'Ultimate', 36),
        (360, false, 'Invisible Woman fires a force field that can penetrate heroes, healing any allies it passes through.', 105031, '/abilities/105031.webp', 'Psionic Strike', 'Weapon', 36),
        (361, true, 'The Invisible Woman taps into her powers, channeling Psionic Might to fortify the entire Fantastic Four team. This formidable force bolsters {104000}{000001}{105100}{000003}{101700}, granting damage resistance. Once activated, they can continually generate <Buff>Bonus Health</>, making up for lost Health with each passing moment.', 105081, '/abilities/105081.webp', 'Fantasti-force', 'Normal', 36),
        (362, false, 'Immune to <Debuff>launch-up</>, <Debuff>knock-back</>, and other displacement effects.', 105101, '/abilities/105101.webp', 'Unyielding Will', 'Passive', 37),
        (363, false, 'Rapidly punch forward.', 105111, '/abilities/105111.webp', 'Rocky Jab', 'Weapon', 37),
        (364, false, 'Deliver a devastating Heavy Blow. Can <Debuff>Knock Down</> flying enemies.', 105121, '/abilities/105121.webp', 'Stone Haymaker', 'Weapon', 37),
        (365, false, 'Continuously charge forward, <Debuff>launching up</> enemies and leaving behind a zone at the final position that prevents the use of mobility abilities.', 105131, '/abilities/105131.webp', 'Yancy Street Charge', 'Normal', 37),
        (366, false, 'Jump toward your ally and apply <Buff>damage reduction</> to both of you.', 105141, '/abilities/105141.webp', 'Embattled Leap', 'Normal', 37),
        (367, false, 'Use immense power to launch all enemies in front of you into the air.', 105151, '/abilities/105151.webp', 'Clobberin'' Time', 'Ultimate', 37),
        (368, true, 'The Invisible Woman taps into her powers, channeling Psionic Might to fortify the entire Fantastic Four team. This formidable force bolsters Human Torch, The Thing, and Mister Fantastic, granting damage resistance. Once activated, they can continually generate <Buff>Bonus Health</>, making up for lost Health.', 105191, '/abilities/105191.webp', 'Cooperative Comrades', 'Normal', 37),
        (369, true, 'Wolverine, Hulk{000003}{105100} can interact with each other. Once both parties confirm, Hulk{000003}{105100} can lift Wolverine and press the key to hurl him forward.', 105161, '/abilities/105161.webp', 'Cosmic Fastball', 'Normal', 37),
        (370, false, 'Jump toward an enemy and apply <Buff>damage reduction</> to self.', 105142, '/abilities/105142.webp', 'Battle Blitz', 'Normal', 37),
        (371, true, 'Human Torch can lift The Thing into the air and slam him down, dealing damage, <Debuff>launching</> enemies, and creating a zone that disables mobility abilities.', 105171, '/abilities/105171.webp', 'Flying Thing', 'Normal', 37),
        (372, false, 'Run horizontally along the walls.', 105201, '/abilities/105201.webp', 'Wall Runner', 'Passive', 38),
        (373, false, 'Perform up to three consecutive jumps while airborne.', 105211, '/abilities/105211.webp', 'Crane Leap', 'Normal', 38),
        (374, false, 'Strike the targeted enemy with Jeet Kune Do, and the last strike will <Debuff>Launch Up</> enemies, reducing the cooldown of <Orange>Dragon''s Defense</> with every hit.', 105221, '/abilities/105221.webp', 'Jeet Kune Do', 'Weapon', 38),
        (375, false, 'Assume a defensive stance with a boost of Chi to block incoming attacks and gain <Buff>Damage Reduction</>. Once he exits the defensive stance, he gains <Buff>Bonus Health</> and can strike back with <Orange>Yat Jee Chung Kuen</>.', 105231, '/abilities/105231.webp', 'Dragon''s Defense', 'Normal', 38),
        (376, false, 'Dash forward to pursue the targeted enemy and unleash a flurry of attacks.', 105232, '/abilities/105232.webp', 'Yat Jee Chung Kuen', 'Weapon', 38),
        (377, false, 'Cross legs and channel Chi, recovering health. Excess healing converts to <Buff>Bonus Health</>.', 105241, '/abilities/105241.webp', 'Harmony Recovery', 'Normal', 38),
        (378, false, 'Dash forward, delivering a flying kick when hitting an enemy or reaching full range, dealing damage to nearby enemies. Damage increases with lower enemy health.', 105251, '/abilities/105251.webp', 'K''un-lun Kick', 'Normal', 38),
        (379, false, 'Become living Chi to boost his speed, damage, and attack range, delivering stronger punches while reducing the cooldown of <Orange>Dragon''s Defense</>.', 105261, '/abilities/105261.webp', 'Living Chi', 'Ultimate', 38),
        (380, false, 'Assists in taking down enemies allow him to absorb their Chi and gain <Buff>Bonus Health</>.', 105203, '/abilities/105203.webp', 'Chi Absorption', 'Passive', 38),
        (381, true, 'Iron Fist channels the Chi of Shou-Lao into Luna Snow, transforming her ice power into a Chi-infused frosty ring that radiates from her. This ring can launch up enemies with chilling damage and applies a slowing effect, while simultaneously healing her allies.', 105271, '/abilities/105271.webp', 'Dragon''s Chill', 'Normal', 38),
        (382, false, 'Launch the ball forward with incredible speed.', 105291, '/abilities/105291.webp', 'LION''S LAUNCH', 'Weapon', 38),
        (383, false, 'Hurl the ball with fierce intensity. Charging longer enhances both speed and distance.', 105292, '/abilities/105292.webp', 'FEROCIOUS THROW', 'Weapon', 38),
        (384, false, 'Perform up to three consecutive jumps while airborne.', 105212, '/abilities/105212.webp', 'CRANE LEAP', 'Normal', 38),
        (385, false, 'Sprint forward and hit the enemy or use a flying kick to launch surrounding enemies up upon reaching maximum distance, causing the enemy to lose the ball. This ability can only be used when not in possession of the ball.', 105252, '/abilities/105252.webp', 'LION KICK', 'Normal', 38),
        (386, true, 'Luna Snow grants Winter''s Chill to Hawkeye and Iron Fist. Hawkeye can shoot an <Orange>Ice Arrow</> that <Debuff>Stuns</> enemies if it travels a certain distance; otherwise, it <Debuff>Slows</> the target. The farther the arrow flies, the more damage it deals. When Iron Fist activates <Orange>Harmony Recovery</>, he can heal nearby allies with <Orange>Lunar Chi</>.', 105242, '/abilities/105242.webp', 'Lunar Chi', 'Normal', 38),
        (387, false, 'Fire a psionic beam to deal damage; the longer the beam hits, the higher the damage.', 105321, '/abilities/105321.webp', 'Telepathic Pulse', 'Normal', 39),
        (388, false, 'Create a levitating barrier at the designated location.', 105331, '/abilities/105331.webp', 'Mind''s Aegis', 'Normal', 39),
        (389, false, 'Activate <Orange>Diamond Form</> to transform your attack style while gaining <Buff>Damage Reduction</> and becoming <Buff>Unstoppable</>.', 105341, '/abilities/105341.webp', 'Diamond Form', 'Normal', 39),
        (390, false, 'In <Orange>Diamond Form</>, deliver a crushing double-fisted strike to enemies.', 105342, '/abilities/105342.webp', 'Faceted Fury', 'Normal', 39),
        (391, false, 'In <Orange>Diamond Form</>, unleash a flying kick forward and <Debuff>knock back</> enemies; extra damage is dealt if they''re propelled into a wall.', 105343, '/abilities/105343.webp', 'Crystal Kick', 'Normal', 39),
        (392, false, 'In <Orange>Diamond Form</>, lunge forward to grab an enemy, then execute a back slam to inflict damage.', 105344, '/abilities/105344.webp', 'Carbon Crush', 'Normal', 39),
        (393, false, 'Seize control of an enemy''s sentience—damage dealt to the <Orange>sentience</> cascades to the physical form and can be pierced by <Orange>Telepathic Pulse</>. When the sentience shatters, it unleashes extra damage on its owner.', 105351, '/abilities/105351.webp', 'Psychic Spear', 'Normal', 39),
        (394, false, 'Project a forward psychic assault that stuns foes and prevents them from unleashing their Ultimate Abilities; if the effect lingers, it gradually commandeers their mind, forcing them to move toward Emma Frost.', 105361, '/abilities/105361.webp', 'Psionic Seduction', 'Normal', 39),
        (395, true, 'Emma Frost can form a mental link with Magneto and Psylocke, calling on her to create illusory projections. When together, Emma Frost will create a Mental Projection of Magneto and Psylocke, forming a Duplicate Illusion in the enemy''s perspective that confuses foes by moving and casting abilities on its own.', 105381, '/abilities/105381.webp', 'Mind Link', 'Normal', 39),
        (396, false, 'Launch a fiery projectile forward, applying 1 <Orange>Spark</> to enemies hit. Critical hits apply 2 <Orange>Sparks</>. At 3 <Orange>Sparks</> Phoenix triggers a fiery explosion that applies 1 <Orange>Spark</> to enemies around and <Buff>Healing Over Time</> to self. <Orange>Sparks</> from explosions will not stack within a brief period.', 105411, '/abilities/105411.webp', 'Cosmic Flames', 'Weapon', 40),
        (397, false, 'Mark a targeted area with psionic energy, followed by a series of fiery explosions. The first blast <Debuff>Stuns</> enemies, while the subsequent two explosions inflict <Debuff>Slow</>. Applies 1 <Orange>Spark</> to enemies hit.', 105441, '/abilities/105441.webp', 'Psionic Detonation', 'Normal', 40),
        (398, false, 'Merge with the Phoenix, entering a state of free flight. Gain a <Buff>Movement Boost</> while continuously replenishing ammunition.', 105451, '/abilities/105451.webp', 'Dark Ascent', 'Normal', 40),
        (399, false, 'Leave behind an illusion and instantly teleport in the desired direction, followed by detonating the illusion. Enemies hit are applied with 1 <Orange>Spark</>.', 105461, '/abilities/105461.webp', 'Telepathic Illusion', 'Normal', 40),
        (400, false, 'Soar into the sky with the Phoenix and crash down onto a selected area, dealing devastating damage to enemies while creating a shockwave that destroys enemy Summons, Shields, and any <Buff>Bonus Health</>. Enemies hit are applied with 1 <Orange>Spark</>.', 105471, '/abilities/105471.webp', 'Endsong Inferno', 'Ultimate', 40),
        (401, true, 'Jean Grey imbues Wolverine with the awe-inspiring Phoenix Force. With this power, Wolverine''s <Orange>Feral Leap</> transforms into <Orange>Phoenix Warrior</>. While active, he is enveloped in Phoenix flames that continuously scorch nearby enemies, dealing Percentage Damage. In this state, Wolverine''s abilities gain <Buff>Lifesteal</> when inflicting damage.', 105481, '/abilities/105481.webp', 'Mind''s Grace', 'Passive', 40);

insert into mrivals_builder_db.map (competitive, external_id, id, description, full_name, game_mode, location, name, video_link)
values  (false, 1032, 1, 'Beneath the sky-shutting canopy of the World Tree, Yggdrasill, lies the golden glory of Asgard, realm of the gods, now overgrown with the roots and flora. However, the throne-seizing scheme of Loki, god of mischief, threatens the ever-lasting prosperity of this kingdom and all of the Ten Realms.', null, null, 'Yggsgard', 'Yggdrasill Path', 'https://youtu.be/8nYwiVjhBWQ'),
        (false, 1034, 2, 'Another world has emerged from the Timestream Entanglement! It''s time to have some ramen and sushi after that nature walk! I''m thrilled that these foods still retain their classic flavors even in Tokyo of 2099! But it is a pity that there aren''t any Kaiju or giant robots fighting in the city anymore...', null, null, 'Tokyo 2099', 'Shin-Shibuya', 'https://youtu.be/8NUtV1CkyKs'),
        (false, 1101, 3, null, null, null, 'Intergalactic Empire of Wakanda', 'Hall of Djalia', 'https://youtu.be/dz_778SYulo'),
        (false, 1118, 4, 'Doctor Strange''s Sanctum Sanctorum stands as the last beacon of hope in a city consumed by darkness. Protected by ancient wards and powerful magic, it serves as a refuge for those battling the chaos unleashed by Dracula and his legion. Explore its eerie corridors and powerful secrets as you prepare to face the chaos unleashed by Dracula''s dark forces. Are you ready to step into the shadows and uncover the secrets of the Sanctum?', null, null, 'Empire of Eternal Night', 'Sanctum Sanctorum', 'https://youtu.be/pVlerpIo3Pk'),
        (false, 1156, 5, 'Beneath the sky-shutting canopy of the World Tree, Yggdrasill, lies the golden glory of Asgard, realm of the gods, now overgrown with the roots and flora. However, the throne-seizing scheme of Loki, god of mischief, threatens the ever-lasting prosperity of this kingdom and all of the Ten Realms.', null, null, 'Yggsgard', 'Throne Room', 'https://youtu.be/8nYwiVjhBWQ'),
        (false, 1230, 6, 'Another world has emerged from the Timestream Entanglement! It''s time to have some ramen and sushi after that nature walk! I''m thrilled that these foods still retain their classic flavors even in Tokyo of 2099! But it is a pity that there aren''t any Kaiju or giant robots fighting in the city anymore...', null, null, 'Tokyo 2099', 'Shin-Shibuya', 'https://youtu.be/8NUtV1CkyKs'),
        (false, 1244, 7, 'Battered into dormancy for decades, Hydra has hidden its dark ambitions behind the chaos of the times... but as time falls apart, that chaos will usher in a new era for the evil organization... Beneath Charteris Base in Antarctica, Hydra has reawakened a gateway to its otherworldly deity, and the key is the crystal formed from chronal energy. As the ancient Hive approaches from beyond, Hydra seeks to channel its power into a new army of super-soldiers. As the ancient cult prepares to welcome all timelines to its alien chorus, are the heroes truly prepared to confront the many heads of Hydra?', null, null, 'Hydra Charteris Base', 'Frozen Airfield', 'https://youtu.be/vSQ3D9-dWbA'),
        (false, 1245, 8, 'Take a journey above Tokyo 2099 into the Web of Life and Destiny! To patch up the temporal rift, the Master Weaver is working around the clock to spin his magic while also suspending an entire network of islands aloft, far above from the urban hustle. As a lover of time, he''s preserved many more classic Japanese elements, from zen gardens to his own sacred tenshu, where he protects a personal sliver of the Web of Life and Destiny itself. It seems that weaving the Multiverse back together is difficult for one spider, so let''s get Spider-Zero back in action!', null, null, 'Tokyo 2099', 'Spider-Islands', 'https://youtu.be/jqnZzywDfTs'),
        (false, 1267, 9, null, null, null, 'Intergalactic Empire of Wakanda', 'Hall of Djalia', 'https://youtu.be/Sc_cXElDvU0'),
        (false, 1161, 10, 'From a single Vibranium meteorite, Wakanda rose to greatness. Now, at the heart of the galaxy, they’ve uncovered the homeland of that very mound. But no matter how far it''s technology advances, Wakanda''s strength will always be its people. Wakanda Forever!', null, null, 'Intergalactic Empire of Wakanda', 'Stellar Spaceport', 'https://youtu.be/Sc_cXElDvU0');

